  "summary": "Connect the VRF buses to the gateway's four RS-485 ports, set the gateway's IP settings from a web browser, then discover the per-unit BACnet devices. Map each indoor unit's on/off, mode, fan speed and setpoint commands plus room temperature and alarm; outdoor unit devices are for monitoring.",
