  "enable": "No enable point is documented. Wired and wireless controller locks (BV 5, BV 4) and mode/fan locks (MV 3, MV 5) restrict local changes.",
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Factory IP address 192.168.1.8; configure it from a web browser on a PC plugged into the gateway's Ethernet port, using the default admin login printed in the guide.",
   "Device ID per unit = bus (0-3) + type (0 indoor, 1 outdoor) + 2-digit unit address, e.g. 0001 or 1105.",
   "Wiring details are in the LVM and BACnet Gateway installation manual (507897).",
   "Power is 24 VAC; the gateway is DIN-rail mounted."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Instances are not unique across unit types: the same AI or BI number means different things on indoor and outdoor devices.",
   "The setpoint (AV 1) only applies in cool, heat and dry; auto mode uses AV 2 and AV 3.",
   "Outdoor BV 1 is an emergency stop for the outdoor unit, not a normal on/off.",
   "The indoor points list has no separate run-status object; read back BV 1 and MV 1."
  ]
